  "title": "とあって",
  "romanized_label": "toatte",
  "alternate_forms": [],
  "jlpt_level": 1,
  "credits_raw": "LR",
  "meaning": "Because ~; ~ as expected; because ~, naturally ~; Introduces an expected reason for some circumstance that is different from the usual situation.",
  "meaning_example": "Because this is the series of holidays after the bonus season, (unsurprisingly), all the tourist spots are crowded.",
  "meaning_notes": [],
  "sections": [
    {
      "kind": "meaning",
      "source_dom_id": "editable_Meaning_1742",
      "body_text": "Because ~; ~ as expected; because ~, naturally ~; Introduces an expected reason for some circumstance that is different from the usual situation. \n Because this is the series of holidays after the bonus season, (unsurprisingly), all the tourist spots are crowded.",
      "body_html": "<span>Because ~; ~ as expected; because ~, naturally ~; Introduces an expected reason for some circumstance that is different from the usual situation.</span> <br/> <span>Because this is the series of holidays after the bonus season, (unsurprisingly), all the tourist spots are crowded.</span>",
      "credits_raw": "LR"
    }
  ],
  "formations": [],
  "examples": [
    {
      "source_id": 7877,
      "position": 0,
      "japanese": "ボーナス後の連休とあって、観光地はどこも人でいっぱいだ。",
      "japanese_html": "<a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e3%83%9c%e3%83%bc%e3%83%8a%e3%82%b9\"><span>ボーナス</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e5%be%8c%e3%81%ae\"><span>後の</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e9%80%a3%e4%bc%91\"><span>連休</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e3%81%a8%e3%81%82%e3%81%a3%e3%81%a6\"><strong>とあって</strong></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e3%80%81\"><span>、</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e8%a6%b3%e5%85%89%e5%9c%b0%e3%81%af%e3%81%a9%e3%81%93%e3%82%82\"><span>観光地はどこも</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e4%ba%ba%e3%81%a7%e3%81%84%e3%81%a3%e3%81%b1%e3%81%84%e3%81%a0%e3%80%82\"><span>人でいっぱいだ。</span></a>",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "ボーナス後の連休",
          "grammar_highlight": false
        },
        {
          "text": "とあって",
          "grammar_highlight": true
        },
        {
          "text": "、観光地はどこも人でいっぱいだ。",
          "grammar_highlight": false
        }
      ],
      "reading": "ボーナスごのれんきゅうとあって、かんこうちはどこもひとでいっぱいだ。",
      "credits_raw": "LR",
      "translations": [
        {
          "language": "en",
          "text": "Because this is the series of holidays after the bonus season, unsurprisingly, all the tourist spots are crowded.",
          "html": "<strong>Because </strong><span>this is the series of holidays after the bonus season, unsurprisingly, all the tourist spots are crowded. </span>",
          "segments": [
            {
              "text": "Because ",
              "grammar_highlight": true
            },
            {
              "text": "this is the series of holidays after the bonus season, unsurprisingly, all the tourist spots are crowded. ",
              "grammar_highlight": false
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "source_id": 7878,
      "position": 1,
      "japanese": "夏休みが始まったとあって、子供たちはみんな嬉しそうだ。",
      "japanese_html": "<a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e5%a4%8f%e4%bc%91%e3%81%bf%e3%81%8c\"><span>夏休みが</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e5%a7%8b%e3%81%be%e3%81%a3%e3%81%9f\"><span>始まった</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e3%81%a8%e3%81%82%e3%81%a3%e3%81%a6\"><strong>とあって</strong></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e3%80%81\"><span>、</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e5%ad%90%e4%be%9b%e3%81%9f%e3%81%a1%e3%81%af%e3%81%bf%e3%82%93%e3%81%aa\"><span>子供たちはみんな</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e5%ac%89%e3%81%97%e3%81%9d%e3%81%86%e3%81%a0%e3%80%82\"><span>嬉しそうだ。</span></a>",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "夏休みが始まった",
          "grammar_highlight": false
        },
        {
          "text": "とあって",
          "grammar_highlight": true
        },
        {
          "text": "、子供たちはみんな嬉しそうだ。",
          "grammar_highlight": false
        }
      ],
      "reading": "なつやすみがはじまったとあって、こどもたちはみんなうれしそうだ。",
      "credits_raw": "LR",
      "translations": [
        {
          "language": "en",
          "text": "Summer vacation has begun, so the children all look happy.",
          "html": "<span>Summer vacation has begun, </span><strong>so </strong><span>the children all look happy. </span>",
          "segments": [
            {
              "text": "Summer vacation has begun, ",
              "grammar_highlight": false
            },
            {
              "text": "so ",
              "grammar_highlight": true
            },
            {
              "text": "the children all look happy. ",
              "grammar_highlight": false
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "source_id": 7879,
      "position": 2,
      "japanese": "人気スターがやって来るとあって、空港は大勢の人たちが待ち受けていた",
      "japanese_html": "<a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e4%ba%ba%e6%b0%97%e3%82%b9%e3%82%bf%e3%83%bc%e3%81%8c%e3%82%84%e3%81%a3%e3%81%a6\"><span>人気スターがやって</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e6%9d%a5%e3%82%8b\"><span>来る</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e3%81%a8%e3%81%82%e3%81%a3%e3%81%a6\"><strong>とあって</strong></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e3%80%81\"><span>、</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e7%a9%ba%e6%b8%af%e3%81%af\"><span>空港は</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e5%a4%a7%e5%8b%a2%e3%81%ae\"><span>大勢の</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e4%ba%ba%e3%81%9f%e3%81%a1%e3%81%8c\"><span>人たちが</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e5%be%85%e3%81%a1\"><span>待ち</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e5%8f%97%e3%81%91%e3%81%a6%e3%81%84%e3%81%9f\"><span>受けていた</span></a>",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "人気スターがやって来る",
          "grammar_highlight": false
        },
        {
          "text": "とあって",
          "grammar_highlight": true
        },
        {
          "text": "、空港は大勢の人たちが待ち受けていた",
          "grammar_highlight": false
        }
      ],
      "reading": "にんきスターがやってくるとあって、くうこうはおおぜいのひとたちがまちうけていた",
      "credits_raw": "LR",
      "translations": [
        {
          "language": "en",
          "text": "because a popular star is coming, a large crowd gathered to meet him at the airport",
          "html": "<strong>because </strong><span>a popular star is coming, a large crowd gathered to meet him at the airport </span>",
          "segments": [
            {
              "text": "because ",
              "grammar_highlight": true
            },
            {
              "text": "a popular star is coming, a large crowd gathered to meet him at the airport ",
              "grammar_highlight": false
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "source_id": 7880,
      "position": 3,
      "japanese": "掃除が終わったらお菓子がもらえるとあって、子供たちは一生懸命手伝っている。",
      "japanese_html": "<a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e6%8e%83%e9%99%a4%e3%81%8c\"><span>掃除が</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e7%b5%82%e3%82%8f%e3%81%a3%e3%81%9f%e3%82%89%e3%81%8a\"><span>終わったらお</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e8%8f%93%e5%ad%90%e3%81%8c%e3%82%82%e3%82%89%e3%81%88%e3%82%8b\"><span>菓子がもらえる</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e3%81%a8%e3%81%82%e3%81%a3%e3%81%a6\"><strong>とあって</strong></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e3%80%81\"><span>、</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e5%ad%90%e4%be%9b%e3%81%9f%e3%81%a1%e3%81%af\"><span>子供たちは</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e4%b8%80%e7%94%9f%e6%87%b8%e5%91%bd%e6%89%8b%e4%bc%9d%e3%81%a3%e3%81%a6%e3%81%84%e3%82%8b%e3%80%82\"><span>一生懸命手伝っている。</span></a>",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "掃除が終わったらお菓子がもらえる",
          "grammar_highlight": false
        },
        {
          "text": "とあって",
          "grammar_highlight": true
        },
        {
          "text": "、子供たちは一生懸命手伝っている。",
          "grammar_highlight": false
        }
      ],
      "reading": "そうじがおわったらおかしがもらえるとあって、こどもたちはいっしょうけんめいてつだっている。",
      "credits_raw": "LR",
      "translations": [
        {
          "language": "en",
          "text": "Because they know they'll get sweets after they finish cleaning, the children are doing their very best to help out.",
          "html": "<strong>Because </strong><span>they know they'll get sweets after they finish cleaning, the children are doing their very best to help out. </span>",
          "segments": [
            {
              "text": "Because ",
              "grammar_highlight": true
            },
            {
              "text": "they know they'll get sweets after they finish cleaning, the children are doing their very best to help out. ",
              "grammar_highlight": false
            }
          ]
        }
